				"steps": [
					"**Même unité.** $1~\\unit{cm} = 10^{-2}~\\unit{m}$ et $1~\\unit{μm} = 10^{-6}~\\unit{m}$ : $1~\\unit{cm} = 10^{-2} \\div 10^{-6}~\\unit{μm} = 10^{4}~\\unit{μm} = 10\\,000~\\unit{μm}$.",
					"$$10\\,000 \\div {{a}} = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{solution}}}$$"
				]
			}
		}
